        <div class="callout"><p>This module is used for a contact style page where the form is the main call to action.</p></div>
        <p class="hf__p hf__p--a">Soon you will be able to deploy and manage Elasticsearch, Kibana, and the rest of the Elastic Stack from within the Azure portal as a native Azure service.</p>
        <p class="hf__p hf__p--b">First-party integration with Azure brings you a number of benefits including:</p>
        <ul class="dot-list">
          <li>Find and deploy Elastic on Azure with just a few clicks</li>
          <li>Streamline authentication with single sign-on (SSO) between the Azure and Elastic consoles</li>
          <li>Automate the ingestion of logs and metrics from Azure services</li>
          <li>Secure network traffic between Elastic and other Azure services with Azure Private Link</li>
          <li>Receive consolidated Azure bills containing your Elastic usage charges</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="hf__p">Enter your details below to be considered for private preview, and be the first to hear about our upcoming public preview program and general availability.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hf__form-wrap">
